    <string name="transfer_hint">App colours identify transfers (WhatsApp green, Instagram pink). Turn app colour off to use upload/download colours; a custom progress colour overrides both. Detection needs a progress notification. Set the arrow per app, or what shows when the direction is unknown, under Arrows.</string>
